{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21463380",
      "title": "Understanding Templates",
      "lectureOrder": 65,
      "videoOrder": 58,
      "sourceHash": "46291e918f2bb93fb19cf62dae414f437372e3f955db1d468827d07260df2500",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 4.47,
          "en": "So we can have multiple apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.47,
          "end": 7.6,
          "en": "and I already mentioned that we control different parts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.6,
          "end": 9.56,
          "en": "of the HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.56,
          "end": 11.63,
          "en": "Now, of course, it should be needless to say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.63,
          "end": 15.14,
          "en": "that you shouldn't control the same HTML part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.14,
          "end": 17.18,
          "en": "with different apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.18,
          "end": 19.12,
          "en": "And you also can't use one app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.12,
          "end": 21.76,
          "en": "to control multiple HTML parts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.76,
          "end": 24.88,
          "en": "It's one HTML part per app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.88,
          "end": 27.77,
          "en": "And also, the term HTML part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.77,
          "end": 32.77,
          "en": "or controlled HTML is not entirely correct though I used it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.71,
          "end": 36.618,
          "en": "because I think it's easy to understand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.618,
          "end": 41.618,
          "en": "The official term is template by mounting your app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.44,
          "end": 47.44,
          "en": "your Vue app to a certain place in the DOM in the HTML code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.44,
          "end": 50.7,
          "en": "you make that part of the HTML code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.7,
          "end": 53.55,
          "en": "the template of that Vue app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.55,
          "end": 58.55,
          "en": "So this section is the template of our first Vue app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.56,
          "end": 63.42,
          "en": "which is mounted with this selector to this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.42,
          "end": 65.98,
          "en": "and that other section is the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.98,
          "end": 68.6,
          "en": "of our second Vue app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.6,
          "end": 71.69,
          "en": "And I'm emphasizing this because we're also going to hear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.69,
          "end": 74.87,
          "en": "about the term template later again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.87,
          "end": 78.63,
          "en": "There also are different ways of defining your template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.63,
          "end": 79.68,
          "en": "of an app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.68,
          "end": 82.55,
          "en": "This here is definitely the most common,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.55,
          "end": 86.03,
          "en": "and most convenient one, writing HTML code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.03,
          "end": 88.77,
          "en": "and then mounting your application to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.77,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "this makes a lot of sense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.36,
          "end": 94.13,
          "en": "but actually, it's not the only way of adding a template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.13,
          "end": 98.5,
          "en": "and I wanna show this here as the example of app two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.5,
          "end": 101.64,
          "en": "You can also add a template to a Vue app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.64,
          "end": 104.83,
          "en": "by adding the template option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.83,
          "end": 108.62299999999999,
          "en": "to your app configuration object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.52000000000001,
          "end": 112.89,
          "en": "This template option wants a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.89,
          "end": 115.07,
          "en": "and to write multi-line strings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.07,
          "end": 117.97999999999999,
          "en": "with these I will use backticks here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.97999999999999,
          "end": 120.6,
          "en": "Really just so that I can write multi-line code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.6,
          "end": 122.51,
          "en": "So these are not single quotes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.51,
          "end": 125.25,
          "en": "that's a backtick which is a different character",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.25,
          "end": 127.08,
          "en": "on your keyboard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.08,
          "end": 131.24,
          "en": "And now we could, for example, grab this paragraph here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.24,
          "end": 133.77,
          "en": "and cut it from the HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.77,
          "end": 136.853,
          "en": "and instead add it in this string here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.61,
          "end": 141.82,
          "en": "This now is the template of the second app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.82,
          "end": 145.35,
          "en": "and actually, this was the template before as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.35,
          "end": 148.97,
          "en": "We controlled this section so anything inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.97,
          "end": 151.37,
          "en": "of the section was our template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.37,
          "end": 154.03,
          "en": "Now I'm just defining this differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.03,
          "end": 156.43,
          "en": "Now we still need to mount this app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.43,
          "end": 159.05,
          "en": "because Vue still needs to know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.05,
          "end": 163.41,
          "en": "where to display this template with the actual value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 166.82999999999998,
          "en": "for a favorite meal when it is rendered on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.82999999999998,
          "end": 170.56,
          "en": "So we still need to mount it otherwise Vue wouldn't know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.56,
          "end": 174.1,
          "en": "where to add this paragraph on the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.1,
          "end": 176.28,
          "en": "But with that if I save it and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.28,
          "end": 178.43,
          "en": "you'll see the same output as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.43,
          "end": 181.41,
          "en": "The template is just defined differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.41,
          "end": 183.93,
          "en": "Now in reality you will most",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.93,
          "end": 187.23,
          "en": "often use the approach we used this far.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 187.23,
          "end": 189.54,
          "en": "We get nicer syntax highlighting there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.54,
          "end": 191.2,
          "en": "it's easier to understand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.2,
          "end": 192.99,
          "en": "and there is no great reason",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.99,
          "end": 195.453,
          "en": "for using this string based template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 196.3,
          "end": 198.76,
          "en": "We will however, learn about a different way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 198.76,
          "end": 203.68,
          "en": "of defining a template and of writing Vue code in general,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.68,
          "end": 205.54,
          "en": "in a couple of modules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.54,
          "end": 207.1,
          "en": "not a drastic change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.1,
          "end": 209,
          "en": "but a nicer way of doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209,
          "end": 211.31,
          "en": "So that's also why I'm emphasizing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.31,
          "end": 213.653,
          "en": "this template part right now already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.97,
          "end": 218.8,
          "en": "For the moment, just be aware of this template concept,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.8,
          "end": 221.11,
          "en": "and that of course, there's nothing wrong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 221.11,
          "end": 223.2,
          "en": "with the approach we used before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.2,
          "end": 225.37,
          "en": "but that with that approach we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.37,
          "end": 228.04,
          "en": "in the end made all the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.04,
          "end": 232.62,
          "en": "of the Vue controlled HTML part the template of that app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.62,
          "end": 233.963,
          "en": "that controlled that part.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
